{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は京都にてアルバムの個別握手会でした〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さんありがとうございましたm(_ _)m"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/15/9815329/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天の生配信に出演しました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/15/9815329/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初のぎ天！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"釣りサークルに入りたいとお願いしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"叶うといいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずはゴルフ部やりたいって！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都寒かったね〜\n皆様風邪ひかぬよう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はやっと風邪治りました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVEに向けて体作りまたしっかりやろうっと！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからは拡散希望です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVEでの生駒ちゃんのサイリウムの色は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青と紫でお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一度！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青と紫でお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青は生駒ちゃんの好きな色。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紫は乃木坂カラー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも外せないっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし、もし願いが叶うのなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水玉模様のとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青と紫のサイリウムを振って頂けるとありがたいです(；д；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう16歳じゃないし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソロ曲をやる機会はバースデーしかないし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかく頂いた曲なので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生懸命頑張りたいと思います！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんソロ曲、\nなぁちゃんソロ曲、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人とも上手いし。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんは伴奏とかするのかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃん圧倒的な可愛さ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふっ不安"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/15/9815329/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもでもっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人でも多くの方になんでもいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘタだな〜\n案外いいじゃん！\n生駒音程ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プラスでもマイナスでも面白いと思って下さるように頑張ろう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く次の曲行かないかな〜寒い〜は思わせたくない！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"練習するっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVE久しぶり！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あばれるぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/02/15/9815329/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}